Package: m6APrediction
Type: Package
Title: Prediction of m6A RNA Modification Sites from Genomic Features
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person("Xuanhe", "Guo", email = "xuanhe.Guo22@student.xjtlu.edu.cn", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Predicts N6-methyladenosine (m6A) RNA modification sites from
    genomic and sequence features using a fitted random forest model. Provides
    batch prediction (prediction_multiple) and single-site prediction
    (prediction_single) functions.
License: MIT 
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 3.5.0)
Imports: randomForest, stats
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
